---
import { Picture } from "astro:assets";
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { meta } from "../data";
import portrait from "../assets/gennady-shafir.jpg";
---

<Base title={meta.about.title} description={meta.about.description} canonical="/about/" ogImage="/og/shared.jpg" ogImageAlt="Gennady Shafir, CFO and board advisor" personJsonLd>
  <section class="about-page">
    <h1>About</h1>
    <div class="about-intro">
      <Picture
        src={portrait}
        alt="Gennady Shafir"
        class="about-portrait"
        widths={[280, 560]}
        formats={["avif", "webp"]}
        sizes="(max-width: 620px) 100vw, 280px"
        width={280}
        height={350}
        loading="eager"
      />
      <p>I am Gennady Shafir, a CFO and board advisor working between the UAE, London and Luxembourg. I have spent the past decade on the operating side of venture-backed companies, as CEO, co-founder, COO and CFO. Now I work with founders between pre-seed and Series A on finance, ownership and structure.</p>
    </div>

    <h2>Track record</h2>
    <p>As CEO and co-founder, built a B2B e-commerce company to over $50 million in annual revenue and more than 200 employees across multiple markets.</p>
    <p>As COO and CFO, scaled a 3D-printing hardware company operating in over 30 countries through its Series B, at a valuation above $100 million.</p>
    <p>As CFO of a deep-tech energy company, led finance and capital raising, with more than $10 million secured across MENA and the EU.</p>
    <p>Across these roles: PE and VC transactions, cross-border structures involving the UAE, Europe and Central Asia, and diligence work on both sides of the table.</p>

    <h2>Why I start with structure</h2>
    <p>I have been on the operating side of a transaction that did not close. The business was working. The corporate structure could not take the investment.</p>
    <p>Since then I start every company with the same four questions. Who owns what. Who can block what. Which entity holds the value. Where the cash is.</p>

    <h2>How I work</h2>
    <p>Inside the team, on the board, or one defined piece of work to start. The situations and what each involves are on the Work page. What I have learned along the way is in the library.</p>
    <p class="about-links"><a href="/work/">See the work →</a><a href="/library/">Read the library →</a></p>

    <h2>Introducing me to someone</h2>
    <p>A short version you can copy.</p>
    <p>Gennady Shafir is a CFO and board advisor working between the UAE, London and Luxembourg. He has been CEO, COO and CFO in venture-backed companies, including a B2B e-commerce business built to over $50M in annual revenue and a hardware company scaled through a Series B at a valuation above $100M. He works with founders and investors on finance, ownership and cross-border structure, usually before a financing round. menadd.com</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Email: <a href="mailto:gennady@menadd.com">gennady@menadd.com</a></p>
    <p>LinkedIn: <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/gennadyshafir">linkedin.com/in/gennadyshafir</a></p>
    <a class="button-link" href="/start/">Start a conversation</a>
  </section>
</Base>
